From dff0ce31c9630f7d601d3d2dd9fd6b06ee00cfc1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: 3 ax <3axmail@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 17:25:49 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] brand: adopt the Scoria motion cube everywhere

Use the chosen s2 mark for the Windows .ico, macOS .icns, Linux hicolor,
the game window icon and the in-app Mark (packaged under brand/ beside the
binary). The public landing gets the matching SVG; make_icons.sh stays the
single generator.

Co-Authored-By: DeepSeek <noreply@deepseek.com>
